 be making mcu  appearances after all we've already seen  daredevil well we've seen charlie cox  but we did see kingpin and now a  daredevil series is coming to disney  plus in the future and not to mention  daredevil will be in the echo series as  well but according to a new report from  screen geek they have been told by a  source that kristen ritter aka jessica  jones is going to be appearing in an mcu  project soon now after seeing matt  murdock show up in spider-man no way  home after seeing kingpin show up in the  hawkeye series and then blackbolt  showing up in multiverse of madness  although he's an inhuman of course not a  defender but the main point is that  marvel studios seems to be taking these  characters that used to be on the  netflix series and has zero problem with  weaving them into the mcu so right now  it is literally possible that any of the  defenders any of the old inhumans any  people from agents of shield it's  entirely possible that they could appear  in the mcu the multiverse has shown us  that anything is now possible in the  grand scale of the marvel cinematic  universe and if this report is accurate  it looks like we will be seeing jessica  jones soon now to top it all off we have  some guardians of the galaxy vol 3 and  guardians of galaxy holiday special news  it has been confirmed that daniella  melquire has joined the cast of  guardians of the galaxy vol 3. this was  reported by deadline but confirmed by  james gunn you gotta love that about  james gunn when reports happen and break  on the internet he's always there to  either debunk them or confirm if they're  true so james gunn said on twitter i can  confirm and confirm she's wonderful in  the role daniela mcguire is one of my  favorite people and actors around and i  hope this is just the second of many  projects we'll work on together now the  deadline report did not mention what  role she was playing and james gunn did  not confirm that role either but it is  said to be a small role and not a  massive role now if you watched the  suicide squad from james gunn you know  that she was in this movie as ratcatcher  and she did an amazing job so i'm  excited to see her in guardians 3. now  guardians 3 and the holiday special have  finished filming they've wrapped and  they sent out rap gifts the gifts that  they give to the cast and crew once  something is done filming this was  shared by mark mantastic on tick-tock we  have a couple of hats one is of rocket  raccoon and the other one seems to be of  groot but this could be a different  character this is from the holiday  special and it looks like it's some type  of a christmas tree with the character  in front of it but the last time that we  saw groot he was a teenager and in the  thor love and thunder trailer he is  still a teenager and this looks like a  full adult groot the groot that we saw  in the first guardians of the galaxy  film so this could be group or this  could be the high evolutionary or a  character that the high evolutionary  could have created with his experiments  but then we take a look at the top right  we have a new logo for the guardians of  the galaxy you can see the old logo is  on the bottom for comparison and it  looks like the logo is simply stepping  away from the guardian's name on it now  it's speculated that this could mean  that the guardians are becoming more of  an official team we do know that this is  pretty much the last film of this  guardian's team we're expecting a few  deaths to happen in guardians 3. james  gunn and a few members of the cast have  mentioned that this is it for them  they're done after this so perhaps the  guardians become a real guardians of the  galaxy team where members can actually  join and leave at any point in time that  way the members can leave but the  guardian's team always remains a knack  they're always going to be the guardians  of the galaxy but characters like nova  or adam warlock or the silver surfer can  always jo